cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "TabPFN-Anchor"
abstract: >-
  Anchor-conditioned ensemble adaptation of a tabular foundation model for
  high-dimensional cancer subtype classification. A cascaded supervised ranking
  produces a reportable 100-gene anchor signature; lower-ranked genes supply
  ordered additional context to multiple fixed-width TabPFN views combined by a
  stacked meta-learner.
type: software
